  "_comment": "DEMO_MODE connector registry (Phase 2). A template: {PLUGIN_ROOT} and {FLEET_ROOT} are substituted by scripts/demo/render_config.py into state/working/demo-mcp.resolved.json, which is what --mcp-config actually loads. Server names match mcp/connectors.example.json so tool names stay mcp__<server>__<tool> in demo and live alike.",
  "mcpServers": {
